# Kappa Cannoneer: "put a +1/+1 counter on this creature. It can't be blocked this turn." On turn 3 Bot1 casts an Ornithopter,
# another artifact entering, and the Cannoneer attacks: Bot2's Ornithopter cannot block it (! Block). On turn 5 no artifact
# enters, and the same block is allowed (the positive control): "this turn" ended with the turn. The other Ornithopter
# attacks too so that Bot2 is asked to block at all; the 6/6 Cannoneer is unblocked on turn 3 (20 - 6 = 14).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Black Lotus
Kappa Cannoneer
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Island
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x15

