Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Kappa Cannoneer.Cast(Convoke: Mox Ruby, Mox Jet, Mox Pearl)
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
